ent: node1 had a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged the scheduled reboot, changed boot identity, returned to a running state, recovered sshd and getty, retained both banner files, and reproduced the live SSH banner. The fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["No literal local-console transcript or image was captured; local display is supported by the exact /etc/issue content and the active recovered agetty process.","The lifecycle inventory did not cover the conditional `.before-login-banner` backup paths, so their preexistence and final presence are unknown."]}
